{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link.
    
    LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
    
    STATE
    - Track a single activeIndex and loop infinitely.
    - "Next" makes the first card the active slide. Clicking any card makes that card's slide active, and the expansion starts from that card's position.
    - Ignore input while a transition runs (about 1.3s).
    
    NEXT / CARD-CLICK TRANSITION (about 1.2s; easing cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1) unless stated)
    1. 0ms — The clicked card scales to 1.04 over 150ms.
    2. 0–650ms — The card grows into the new background:
       - Place a full-size layer holding the new slide's background image above the old background.
       - Start it with clip-path: inset(...) that matches the card's exact rect, measured with getBoundingClientRect relative to the section, with a 10px radius.
       - Animate the clip-path to inset(0 round 0). The image keeps its final full-screen framing and is revealed through a growing window. It also scales from 1.1 to 1.
       - Hide the real card the moment this starts.
    3. 0–650ms — The old scene darkens: the old background goes to filter: brightness(.25), and the old left text fades to 20% opacity in place without moving. A dark frame stays visible around the growing image.
    4. 650ms — The new image becomes the real background and the layer is removed. Swap in the new slide's text, hidden and ready to reveal.
    5. 60–750ms — The cards shift left by one slot, each lagging 80ms behind the card before it. The gaps briefly widen, then close up; this elastic-gap look is important. Each card moves for 600ms with cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1). The slide that just left the background is added as the last card: it fades in from translateX(40px), opacity 0 → 1, over 400ms, after the others settle.
    6. From 550ms — Text reveal: each element starts 90ms after the previous one and runs 600ms with cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1):
       - dash: scaleX 0 → 1, transform-origin left
       - eyebrow: translateY(105%) → 0 inside its mask
       - title line 1, then title line 2: translateY(105%) → 0 inside their masks, so the letters rise up from a hidden baseline
       - description: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
       - button row: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
    7. From 300ms — The counter rolls up: the old number goes from translateY(0) to -100% while the new one comes up from 100% to 0, both over 450ms.
    8. From 300ms — The progress line's accent fill animates to activeIndex ÷ total over 600ms.
    
    PREV TRANSITION (mirror of Next)
    - The current background shrinks back into a card at the first card slot: clip-path goes from inset(0) to that slot's rect over 650ms. The previous slide's image sits underneath and brightens from .25 to 1.
    - The cards shift right by one slot with the same 80ms lag between cards. The last card fades out to the right.
    - Use the same text reveal. The counter rolls downward instead.
    
    AUTOPLAY + TOP BAR
    - When autoplay is on, the 3px top bar grows linearly from 0 to 100% over "autoplay seconds". At 100%, trigger Next. Reset the bar to 0 instantly and restart it once the transition ends.
    - Pause when the slider is hovered (if that setting is on), when the tab is hidden (visibilitychange), and when the section is off-screen (IntersectionObserver). While paused, the bar freezes and later resumes from where it stopped. Drive it with requestAnimationFrame and elapsed time.
    - Any manual navigation resets the bar.
    
    INPUT
    - Prev and next buttons, card clicks, the ←/→ keys when the slider is focused, and a horizontal swipe on the background (50px threshold).
    - ≤749px: after each change, smooth-scroll the card row back to the start.
    
    FIRST LOAD
    The background fades in while scaling from 1.08 to 1 over 1.2s. Then the text reveal runs once, and the cards fade up from translateY(30px), each 80ms after the previous one.
    
    QUALITY
    - Animate only transform, opacity, clip-path and filter. Apply will-change only while a transition is running.
    - prefers-reduced-motion: replace every effect with a 300ms crossfade, and keep the top bar static.
    - After each change, preload the next slide's background image.
    - Accessibility: give the wrapper role="region" and aria-roledescription="carousel". Give the arrows aria-labels. Label each card "Go to {title}". Add an aria-live="polite" region that announces "Slide 2 of 6: Nagano Prefecture".
    - Theme editor: re-initialise on shopify:section:load, clear timers and observers on shopify:section:unload, and turn autoplay off when Shopify.designMode is true.
    - Wrap all JS in an IIFE scoped to this block's id. Use no globals.
{% enddoc %}

{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign display_font = block.settings.display_font %}
{% assign body_font = block.settings.body_font %}

{% style %}
  {{ display_font | font_face }}
  {{ body_font | font_face }}

  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100svh;
    min-height: 640px;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #111;
    color: #fff;
    isolation: isolate;
    font-family: {{ body_font.family | default: settings.type_body_font.family }}, sans-serif;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_weight | default: 400 }};
  }

  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:before,
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Autoplay Topbar */
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-topbar {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 20;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: transparent;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-topbar-fill {
    display: block;
    width: 0%;
    height: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color | default: '#ECAB32' }};
  }

  /* Background */
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-bg-wrapper {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-bg-image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: #252525;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-placeholder svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    color: #555;
  }

  /* Overlays */
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), transparent 20%),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 30%, transparent 60%),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | default: 25 | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  /* Left Content */
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-content {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 4;
    left: 5vw;
    top: 35%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.copy_width | default: 420 }}px;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-dash {
    display: block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 3px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    background: #fff;
    transform-origin: left;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-loc-mask {
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-location {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.location_size | default: 18 }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.location_weight | default: 300 }};
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: {{ display_font.family | default: settings.type_header_font.family }}, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | default: 64 }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight | default: 700 }};
    line-height: 1.02;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title-mask {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title-line {
    display: block;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-description {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin: 18px 0 28px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size | default: 14 }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_weight | default: 400 }};
    line-height: 1.75;
    will-change: transform, opacity;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    will-change: transform, opacity;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    flex: 0 0 38px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color | default: '#ECAB32' }};
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save:hover {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link {
    height: 40px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size | default: 11 }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_weight | default: 500 }};
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link:hover {
    background: #fff;
    color: #111;
  }

  /* Cards Track */
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-track {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 4;
    left: 41%;
    top: 42%;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.9vw;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px);
    aspect-ratio: 13/20;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #222;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    transition: box-shadow 300ms ease;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 28px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 30% 0 0;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8) 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-copy {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    left: 16px;
    right: 12px;
    bottom: 20px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-dash {
    display: block;
    width: 12px;
    height: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-loc {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-title {
    display: block;
    font-family: {{ display_font.family | default: settings.type_header_font.family }}, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size | default: 18 }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_weight | default: 700 }};
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-price {
    display: block;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size | default: 13 }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.price_weight | default: 400 }};
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color | default: '#ECAB32' }};
  }

  /* Controls Row */
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 4;
    left: 41%;
    right: 4vw;
    top: 91%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    flex: 0 0 60px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: #fff;
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow svg {
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 0 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    position: relative;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress-fill {
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.5px;
    left: 0;
    width: 0%;
    height: 2px;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color | default: '#ECAB32' }};
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter-box {
    width: 78px;
    flex: 0 0 78px;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 1.15em;
    position: relative;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    font-family: {{ display_font.family | default: settings.type_header_font.family }}, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.counter_size | default: 42 }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter-digit {
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 100%;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} button:focus-visible,
  .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #fff;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* Responsive Rules */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-track {
      left: 46%;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card {
      flex-basis: clamp(150px, 18vw, 190px);
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls {
      left: 46%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 100svh;
      min-height: 560px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-content {
      left: 5vw;
      top: 10%;
      max-width: 90vw;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-dash {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-loc-mask {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 7.5vw, 40px);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-description {
      max-width: 88vw;
      margin: 8px 0 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-actions {
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      flex: 0 0 36px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link {
      height: 36px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-track {
      left: 5vw;
      right: 0;
      top: auto;
      bottom: 80px;
      gap: 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      padding-right: 5vw;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-track::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card {
      flex: 0 0 clamp(118px, 32vw, 136px);
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-copy {
      left: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      bottom: 12px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-loc {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-price {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls {
      left: 5vw;
      right: 5vw;
      top: auto;
      bottom: 18px;
      transform: none;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      flex-basis: 44px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress {
      margin: 0 10px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter-box {
      width: 44px;
      flex-basis: 44px;
    }
    .pr-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter {
      font-size: 26px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  id="product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  class="pr-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  role="region"
  aria-roledescription="carousel"
  aria-label="Product destination hero"
  data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay | default: true }}"
  data-seconds="{{ block.settings.autoplay_seconds | default: 6 }}"
  data-pause="{{ block.settings.pause_on_hover | default: true }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="dh-topbar">
    <span class="dh-topbar-fill"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dh-bg-wrapper">
    {% assign first_bg = '' %}
    {% assign first_product = block.settings.products.first %}
    {% if block.settings.background_1 %}
      {% assign first_bg = block.settings.background_1 | image_url: width: 2400 %}
    {% elsif first_product.featured_image %}
      {% assign first_bg = first_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 2400 %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if first_bg != blank %}
      <img
        class="dh-bg-image"
        src="{{ first_bg }}"
        alt="{{ first_product.title | default: 'Hero background' | escape }}"
        fetchpriority="high"
        loading="eager"
        width="2400"
        height="1350"
      >
    {% else %}
      <div class="dh-placeholder">
        {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
      </div>
      <img class="dh-bg-image" src="" alt="" style="display:none;" width="2400" height="1350">
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="dh-overlay"></div>

  <div class="dh-content">
    <span class="dh-dash"></span>
    <div class="dh-loc-mask">
      <div class="dh-location">
        {% if block.settings.location_text != blank %}
          {{ block.settings.location_text | strip_html }}
        {% else %}
          Featured product
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <h1 class="dh-title">
      <span class="dh-title-mask"><span class="dh-title-line dh-title-line-1"></span></span>
      <span class="dh-title-mask"><span class="dh-title-line dh-title-line-2"></span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="dh-description"></p>
    <div class="dh-actions">
      <button class="dh-save" type="button" aria-label="Save product" aria-pressed="false">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M6 3.75h12v17l-6-4-6 4v-17Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <a class="dh-link" href="#">
        {% if block.settings.button_richtext != blank %}
          {{ block.settings.button_richtext | strip_html }}
        {% else %}
          Shop product
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="dh-track" role="list"></div>

  <div class="dh-controls">
    <button class="dh-arrow dh-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous slide">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="m15 5-7 7 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
    <button class="dh-arrow dh-next" type="button" aria-label="Next slide">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
    <div class="dh-progress" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0">
      <span class="dh-progress-fill"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="dh-counter-box">
      <div class="dh-counter" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="dh-counter-digit current">01</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="dh-live" aria-live="polite" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;"></span>
  </div>

  <script type="application/json" class="dh-data">
    {% if block.settings.products.count > 0 %}
      [
        {% for product in block.settings.products limit: 5 %}
          {% liquid
            assign bg_key = 'background_' | append: forloop.index
            assign bg = block.settings[bg_key]
            assign bg_url = ''
            if bg
              assign bg_url = bg | image_url: width: 2400
            elsif product.featured_image
              assign bg_url = product.featured_image | image_url: width: 2400
            endif
            assign card_img = ''
            if product.featured_image
              assign card_img = product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600
            elsif bg
              assign card_img = bg | image_url: width: 600
            endif
          %}
          {% if forloop.index > 1 %},{% endif %}
          {
            "index": {{ forloop.index0 }},
            "id": {{ product.id | json }},
            "name": {{ product.title | json }},
            "url": {{ product.url | json }},
            "price": {{ product.price | money | json }},
            "description": {{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 160 | json }},
            "image": {{ card_img | json }},
            "bg": {{ bg_url | json }}
          }
        {% endfor %}
      ]
    {% else %}
      [
        { "index": 0, "name": "Cozy Rompers", "url": "/collections/all", "price": "$1,499.00", "description": "Ultra-soft bamboo rompers crafted for delicate baby skin.", "image": "", "bg": "" },
        { "index": 1, "name": "Snuggly Footies", "url": "/collections/all", "price": "$1,549.00", "description": "Naturally breathable footies designed for pure baby comfort.", "image": "", "bg": "" },
        { "index": 2, "name": "Luxurious Bodysuits", "url": "/collections/all", "price": "$1,349.00", "description": "Hypoallergenic bamboo bodysuits with gentle stretch.", "image": "", "bg": "" },
        { "index": 3, "name": "Tranquil Crib Sheets", "url": "/collections/all", "price": "$1,299.00", "description": "Silky-smooth crib sheets for serene night sleeps.", "image": "", "bg": "" },
        { "index": 4, "name": "Sumptuous Bodysuits", "url": "/collections/all", "price": "$1,319.00", "description": "Everyday bamboo essentials thoughtfully crafted with love.", "image": "", "bg": "" }
      ]
    {% endif %}
  </script>

  <script type="application/json" class="dh-custom-copy">
    {
      "location": {{ block.settings.location_text | strip_html | json }},
      "heading": {{ block.settings.heading_richtext | json }},
      "description": {{ block.settings.description_richtext | strip_html | json }},
      "button": {{ block.settings.button_richtext | strip_html | json }},
      "card": {{ block.settings.card_richtext | strip_html | json }}
    }
  </script>

  <script>
    (function() {
      const tag = 'product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
      if (customElements.get(tag)) return;

      class ProductHero extends HTMLElement {
        connectedCallback() {
          const dataEl = this.querySelector('.dh-data');
          if (!dataEl) return;
          try {
            this.data = JSON.parse(dataEl.textContent);
          } catch (e) {
            this.data = [];
          }

          const customEl = this.querySelector('.dh-custom-copy');
          try {
            this.custom = customEl ? JSON.parse(customEl.textContent) : {};
          } catch (e) {
            this.custom = {};
          }

          if (!this.data || !this.data.length) return;

          this.total = this.data.length;
          this.activeIndex = 0;
          this.isAnimating = false;

          // Autoplay settings
          this.autoplayEnabled = this.dataset.autoplay === 'true';
          this.autoplaySeconds = Number(this.dataset.seconds) || 6;
          this.pauseOnHover = this.dataset.pause === 'true';
          this.isPaused = false;
          this.autoplayElapsed = 0;
          this.autoplayRaf = null;

          // DOM Refs
          this.topbarFill = this.querySelector('.dh-topbar-fill');
          this.bgWrapper = this.querySelector('.dh-bg-wrapper');
          this.bgImage = this.querySelector('.dh-bg-image');
          this.content = this.querySelector('.dh-content');
          this.dash = this.querySelector('.dh-dash');
          this.locationEl = this.querySelector('.dh-location');
          this.titleLine1 = this.querySelector('.dh-title-line-1');
          this.titleLine2 = this.querySelector('.dh-title-line-2');
          this.descEl = this.querySelector('.dh-description');
          this.actionsEl = this.querySelector('.dh-actions');
          this.saveBtn = this.querySelector('.dh-save');
          this.linkBtn = this.querySelector('.dh-link');
          this.track = this.querySelector('.dh-track');
          this.prevBtn = this.querySelector('.dh-prev');
          this.nextBtn = this.querySelector('.dh-next');
          this.progressFill = this.querySelector('.dh-progress-fill');
          this.counterBox = this.querySelector('.dh-counter');
          this.liveRegion = this.querySelector('.dh-live');

          // Initialize events
          this.initEvents();

          // Render initial UI
          this.renderTrackCards(0);
          this.updateProgress(0, false);
          this.updateCounter(0, 'none');
          this.updateLiveRegion(0);

          // Accessibility setup
          this.tabIndex = 0;

          // Check reduced motion
          this.prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

          if (this.prefersReduced) {
            this.setupTextForReveal(this.data[0]);
            this.triggerTextInstant();
            if (this.autoplayEnabled && !(window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode)) {
              this.startAutoplay();
            }
          } else {
            this.runFirstLoad();
          }

          // Theme editor listeners
          this.onSectionUnload = (e) => {
            if (e.target.contains(this)) {
              this.cleanup();
            }
          };
          document.addEventListener('shopify:section:unload', this.onSectionUnload);
        }

        disconnectedCallback() {
          this.cleanup();
        }

        cleanup() {
          this.stopAutoplay();
          if (this.observer) this.observer.disconnect();
          document.removeEventListener('shopify:section:unload', this.onSectionUnload);
        }

        initEvents() {
          if (this.nextBtn) {
            this.nextBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
              e.preventDefault();
              this.next();
            });
          }

          if (this.prevBtn) {
            this.prevBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
              e.preventDefault();
              this.prev();
            });
          }

          if (this.track) {
            this.track.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
              const card = e.target.closest('.dh-card');
              if (!card || this.isAnimating) return;
              e.preventDefault();
              const slideIdx = parseInt(card.dataset.slideIndex, 10);
              this.goTo(slideIdx, 'next', card);
            });
          }

          if (this.saveBtn) {
            this.saveBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
              const on = this.saveBtn.getAttribute('aria-pressed') === 'true';
              this.saveBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!on));
              const path = this.saveBtn.querySelector('path');
              if (path) path.setAttribute('fill', on ? 'none' : 'currentColor');
            });
          }

          // Keyboard navigation
          this.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') {
              e.preventDefault();
              this.next();
            } else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') {
              e.preventDefault();
              this.prev();
            }
          });

          // Touch swipe
          let touchStartX = 0;
          let touchStartY = 0;
          this.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
            if (!e.touches.length) return;
            touchStartX = e.touches[0].clientX;
            touchStartY = e.touches[0].clientY;
          }, { passive: true });

          this.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
            if (!e.changedTouches.length) return;
            const diffX = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - touchStartX;
            const diffY = e.changedTouches[0].clientY - touchStartY;
            if (Math.abs(diffX) > 50 && Math.abs(diffX) > Math.abs(diffY)) {
              if (diffX < 0) this.next();
              else this.prev();
            }
          }, { passive: true });

          // Hover pause
          if (this.pauseOnHover) {
            this.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
              this.isPaused = true;
            });
            this.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
              this.isPaused = false;
            });
          }

          // Visibility pause
          document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
            if (document.hidden) {
              this.isPaused = true;
            } else {
              this.isPaused = false;
            }
          });

          // Intersection observer pause
          if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
            this.observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
              entries.forEach((entry) => {
                this.isPaused = !entry.isIntersecting;
              });
            }, { threshold: 0.1 });
            this.observer.observe(this);
          }
        }

        getLocationText() {
          if (this.custom && this.custom.location && this.custom.location.trim()) {
            return this.custom.location.trim();
          }
          return 'Featured product';
        }

        splitTitle(title, customHeading) {
          if (customHeading && customHeading.trim()) {
            const clean = customHeading.replace(/<\/?p>/gi, '').trim();
            if (clean.includes('<br')) {
              const parts = clean.split(/<br\s*\/?>/i);
              return [parts[0].trim(), parts.slice(1).join(' ').trim()];
            }
          }
          const cleanTitle = (title || '').trim();
          const words = cleanTitle.split(/\s+/);
          if (words.length <= 1) return [cleanTitle, ''];
          if (words.length === 2) return [words[0], words[1]];
          if (words.length === 3) return [words[0] + ' ' + words[1], words[2]];
          const mid = Math.ceil(words.length / 2);
          return [words.slice(0, mid).join(' '), words.slice(mid).join(' ')];
        }

        escapeHtml(str) {
          const div = document.createElement('div');
          div.textContent = str || '';
          return div.innerHTML;
        }

        createCardElement(slide, isLastEntering = false) {
          const btn = document.createElement('button');
          btn.type = 'button';
          btn.className = 'dh-card';
          btn.dataset.slideIndex = slide.index;
          btn.setAttribute('aria-label', `Go to ${slide.name}`);

          const [t1, t2] = this.splitTitle(slide.name, '');

          btn.innerHTML = `
            <img src="${slide.image || slide.bg}" alt="${this.escapeHtml(slide.name)}" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="dh-card-overlay"></span>
            <span class="dh-card-copy">
              <span class="dh-card-dash"></span>
              <span class="dh-card-loc">${this.escapeHtml(this.getLocationText())}</span>
              <span class="dh-card-title">${this.escapeHtml(t1)}<br>${this.escapeHtml(t2)}</span>
              ${slide.price ? `<span class="dh-card-price">${this.escapeHtml(slide.price)}</span>` : ''}
            </span>
          `;

          if (isLastEntering) {
            btn.style.opacity = '0';
            btn.style.transform = 'translateX(40px)';
          }

          return btn;
        }

        renderTrackCards(activeIdx) {
          this.track.innerHTML = '';
          for (let n = 1; n < this.total; n++) {
            const nextIdx = (activeIdx + n) % this.total;
            const card = this.createCardElement(this.data[nextIdx]);
            this.track.appendChild(card);
          }
        }

        setupTextForReveal(slide) {
          const customHeading = slide.index === 0 ? (this.custom && this.custom.heading) : '';
          const [t1, t2] = this.splitTitle(slide.name, customHeading);
          if (this.titleLine1) this.titleLine1.textContent = t1;
          if (this.titleLine2) this.titleLine2.textContent = t2;

          if (this.descEl) {
            const customDesc = (this.custom && this.custom.description && this.custom.description.trim());
            const desc = (slide.index === 0 && customDesc)
              ? customDesc
              : (slide.description || 'Ultra-soft bamboo fabric that\'s gentle on delicate skin.');
            this.descEl.textContent = desc;
          }

          if (this.linkBtn) {
            this.linkBtn.href = slide.url || '#';
            if (this.custom && this.custom.button && this.custom.button.trim()) {
              this.linkBtn.textContent = this.custom.button.trim();
            } else {
              this.linkBtn.textContent = 'Shop product';
            }
          }

          if (this.locationEl) {
            this.locationEl.textContent = this.getLocationText();
          }

          // Initial reveal states
          this.dash.style.transition = 'none';
          this.dash.style.transform = 'scaleX(0)';

          this.locationEl.style.transition = 'none';
          this.locationEl.style.transform = 'translateY(105%)';

          this.titleLine1.style.transition = 'none';
          this.titleLine1.style.transform = 'translateY(105%)';

          if (this.titleLine2) {
            this.titleLine2.style.transition = 'none';
            this.titleLine2.style.transform = 'translateY(105%)';
          }

          this.descEl.style.transition = 'none';
          this.descEl.style.transform = 'translateY(14px)';
          this.descEl.style.opacity = '0';

          this.actionsEl.style.transition = 'none';
          this.actionsEl.style.transform = 'translateY(14px)';
          this.actionsEl.style.opacity = '0';
        }

        triggerTextInstant() {
          this.dash.style.transition = 'none';
          this.dash.style.transform = 'scaleX(1)';

          this.locationEl.style.transition = 'none';
          this.locationEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';

          this.titleLine1.style.transition = 'none';
          this.titleLine1.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';

          if (this.titleLine2) {
            this.titleLine2.style.transition = 'none';
            this.titleLine2.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
          }

          this.descEl.style.transition = 'none';
          this.descEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
          this.descEl.style.opacity = '1';

          this.actionsEl.style.transition = 'none';
          this.actionsEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
          this.actionsEl.style.opacity = '1';
        }

        triggerTextReveal() {
          const ease = 'cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1)';
          const dur = '600ms';

          // Force reflow
          this.dash.offsetHeight;

          // 1. dash
          this.dash.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}`;
          this.dash.style.transform = 'scaleX(1)';

          // 2. eyebrow (+90ms)
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.locationEl.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}`;
            this.locationEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
          }, 90);

          // 3. title line 1 (+180ms)
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.titleLine1.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}`;
            this.titleLine1.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
          }, 180);

          // 4. title line 2 (+270ms)
          setTimeout(() => {
            if (this.titleLine2) {
              this.titleLine2.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}`;
              this.titleLine2.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
            }
          }, 270);

          // 5. description (+360ms)
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.descEl.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}, opacity ${dur} ${ease}`;
            this.descEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
            this.descEl.style.opacity = '1';
          }, 360);

          // 6. actions button row (+450ms)
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.actionsEl.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}, opacity ${dur} ${ease}`;
            this.actionsEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
            this.actionsEl.style.opacity = '1';
          }, 450);
        }

        updateCounter(idx, dir = 'none') {
          if (!this.counterBox) return;
          const numStr = String(idx + 1).padStart(2, '0');

          if (dir === 'none' || this.prefersReduced) {
            this.counterBox.innerHTML = `<span class="dh-counter-digit current">${numStr}</span>`;
            return;
          }

          const currentDigit = this.counterBox.querySelector('.dh-counter-digit.current');
          const nextDigit = document.createElement('span');
          nextDigit.className = 'dh-counter-digit next';
          nextDigit.textContent = numStr;

          const fromY = dir === 'up' ? '100%' : '-100%';
          const toY = dir === 'up' ? '-100%' : '100%';

          nextDigit.style.transform = `translateY(${fromY})`;
          this.counterBox.appendChild(nextDigit);

          // Force reflow
          nextDigit.offsetHeight;

          const ease = 'cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          const dur = '450ms';

          if (currentDigit) {
            currentDigit.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}`;
            currentDigit.style.transform = `translateY(${toY})`;
          }

          nextDigit.style.transition = `transform ${dur} ${ease}`;
          nextDigit.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';

          setTimeout(() => {
            if (currentDigit) currentDigit.remove();
            nextDigit.className = 'dh-counter-digit current';
          }, 450);
        }

        updateProgress(idx, animated = true) {
          if (!this.progressFill) return;
          const pct = (idx / this.total) * 100;
          if (animated && !this.prefersReduced) {
            this.progressFill.style.transition = 'width 600ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          } else {
            this.progressFill.style.transition = 'none';
          }
          this.progressFill.style.width = pct + '%';

          const prog = this.querySelector('.dh-progress');
          if (prog) prog.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', Math.round(pct));
        }

        updateLiveRegion(idx) {
          if (!this.liveRegion || !this.data[idx]) return;
          this.liveRegion.textContent = `Slide ${idx + 1} of ${this.total}: ${this.data[idx].name}`;
        }

        preloadNext(idx) {
          const nextIdx = (idx + 1) % this.total;
          const bg = this.data[nextIdx].bg || this.data[nextIdx].image;
          if (bg) {
            const im = new Image();
            im.src = bg;
          }
        }

        runFirstLoad() {
          if (this.bgImage) {
            this.bgImage.style.opacity = '0';
            this.bgImage.style.transform = 'scale(1.08)';
            this.bgImage.style.transition = 'opacity 1.2s cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1), transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          }

          const cards = Array.from(this.track.children);
          cards.forEach((card) => {
            card.style.opacity = '0';
            card.style.transform = 'translateY(30px)';
          });

          this.setupTextForReveal(this.data[0]);

          requestAnimationFrame(() => {
            if (this.bgImage) {
              this.bgImage.style.opacity = '1';
              this.bgImage.style.transform = 'scale(1)';
            }

            setTimeout(() => {
              this.triggerTextReveal();
            }, 350);

            cards.forEach((card, idx) => {
              setTimeout(() => {
                card.style.transition = 'opacity 500ms ease, transform 500ms cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1)';
                card.style.opacity = '1';
                card.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
              }, 450 + idx * 80);
            });

            setTimeout(() => {
              if (this.autoplayEnabled && !(window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode)) {
                this.startAutoplay();
              }
            }, 1250);
          });
        }

        startAutoplay() {
          if (!this.autoplayEnabled || this.total <= 1 || (window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode)) return;
          this.stopAutoplay();

          const duration = this.autoplaySeconds * 1000;
          let lastTime = performance.now();

          const tick = (now) => {
            if (this.isPaused || this.isAnimating) {
              lastTime = now;
              this.autoplayRaf = requestAnimationFrame(tick);
              return;
            }

            const delta = now - lastTime;
            lastTime = now;
            this.autoplayElapsed += delta;

            const pct = Math.min(1, this.autoplayElapsed / duration);
            if (this.topbarFill) {
              this.topbarFill.style.width = (pct * 100) + '%';
            }

            if (pct >= 1) {
              this.resetAutoplayBar();
              this.next();
              return;
            }

            this.autoplayRaf = requestAnimationFrame(tick);
          };

          this.autoplayRaf = requestAnimationFrame(tick);
        }

        stopAutoplay() {
          if (this.autoplayRaf) {
            cancelAnimationFrame(this.autoplayRaf);
            this.autoplayRaf = null;
          }
        }

        resetAutoplayBar() {
          this.autoplayElapsed = 0;
          if (this.topbarFill) {
            this.topbarFill.style.transition = 'none';
            this.topbarFill.style.width = '0%';
          }
        }

        next() {
          if (this.isAnimating) return;
          this.resetAutoplayBar();
          const targetIndex = (this.activeIndex + 1) % this.total;
          const firstCard = this.track.children[0];
          this.goTo(targetIndex, 'next', firstCard);
        }

        prev() {
          if (this.isAnimating) return;
          this.resetAutoplayBar();
          const targetIndex = (this.activeIndex - 1 + this.total) % this.total;
          this.goTo(targetIndex, 'prev');
        }

        goTo(targetIndex, direction = 'next', fromCardEl = null) {
          if (this.isAnimating || targetIndex === this.activeIndex) return;
          this.isAnimating = true;
          this.stopAutoplay();

          const oldIndex = this.activeIndex;
          const nextIndex = targetIndex;
          const nextSlide = this.data[nextIndex];
          const oldSlide = this.data[oldIndex];

          if (this.prefersReduced) {
            this.performReducedTransition(nextIndex, oldIndex);
            return;
          }

          if (direction === 'prev') {
            this.performPrevTransition(nextIndex, oldIndex);
          } else {
            this.performNextTransition(nextIndex, oldIndex, fromCardEl);
          }
        }

        performReducedTransition(nextIndex, oldIndex) {
          this.content.style.transition = 'opacity 150ms ease';
          this.content.style.opacity = '0';
          if (this.bgImage) {
            this.bgImage.style.transition = 'opacity 150ms ease';
            this.bgImage.style.opacity = '0';
          }

          setTimeout(() => {
            const nextSlide = this.data[nextIndex];
            if (this.bgImage) {
              this.bgImage.src = nextSlide.bg || nextSlide.image;
              this.bgImage.style.opacity = '1';
            }
            this.setupTextForReveal(nextSlide);
            this.triggerTextInstant();
            this.renderTrackCards(nextIndex);
            this.updateCounter(nextIndex, 'none');
            this.updateProgress(nextIndex, false);
            this.updateLiveRegion(nextIndex);
            this.activeIndex = nextIndex;
            this.isAnimating = false;
            this.preloadNext(nextIndex);
            if (this.autoplayEnabled && !(window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode)) {
              this.startAutoplay();
            }
          }, 150);
        }

        performNextTransition(nextIndex, oldIndex, fromCardEl) {
          const nextSlide = this.data[nextIndex];
          const fromCard = fromCardEl || this.track.children[0];

          // 1. 0ms: Scale clicked card to 1.04 over 150ms
          fromCard.style.willChange = 'transform';
          fromCard.style.transition = 'transform 150ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          fromCard.style.transform = 'scale(1.04)';

          const sectionRect = this.getBoundingClientRect();
          const cardRect = fromCard.getBoundingClientRect();
          const top = Math.round(cardRect.top - sectionRect.top);
          const left = Math.round(cardRect.left - sectionRect.left);
          const right = Math.round(sectionRect.width - (left + cardRect.width));
          const bottom = Math.round(sectionRect.height - (top + cardRect.height));

          // Clean up any lingering layer from before
          const existingLayers = this.querySelectorAll('.dh-expand-layer');
          existingLayers.forEach((el) => el.remove());

          // 2. 0-650ms: Full-size layer holding new slide's background grows from card's rect
          const layer = document.createElement('div');
          layer.className = 'dh-expand-layer';
          layer.style.cssText = `
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 3;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
            clip-path: inset(${top}px ${right}px ${bottom}px ${left}px round 10px);
            will-change: clip-path, opacity;
          `;

          const layerImg = document.createElement('img');
          layerImg.src = nextSlide.bg || nextSlide.image;
          layerImg.alt = nextSlide.name;
          layerImg.style.cssText = `
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transform: scale(1.1);
            transform-origin: center center;
            will-change: transform;
          `;
          layer.appendChild(layerImg);
          this.appendChild(layer);

          // Hide real card immediately
          fromCard.style.opacity = '0';

          // 3. 0-650ms: Old scene darkens: old bg brightness(.25), left text fades to 20%
          if (this.bgWrapper) {
            this.bgWrapper.style.willChange = 'filter';
            this.bgWrapper.style.transition = 'filter 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
            this.bgWrapper.style.filter = 'brightness(0.25)';
          }

          this.content.style.willChange = 'opacity';
          this.content.style.transition = 'opacity 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          this.content.style.opacity = '0.2';

          // Animate clip-path to inset(0 round 0) and image scale from 1.1 to 1
          layer.offsetHeight; // Force reflow
          layer.style.transition = 'clip-path 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          layerImg.style.transition = 'transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          layer.style.clipPath = 'inset(0px 0px 0px 0px round 0px)';
          layerImg.style.transform = 'scale(1)';

          // 5. 60-750ms: The cards shift left by one slot with 80ms lag (elastic-gap look)
          const cards = Array.from(this.track.children);
          const firstCard = cards[0];
          const secondCard = cards[1];
          const slotDist = secondCard
            ? Math.round(secondCard.getBoundingClientRect().left - firstCard.getBoundingClientRect().left)
            : Math.round(firstCard.offsetWidth + 20);

          cards.forEach((c, idx) => {
            setTimeout(() => {
              c.style.willChange = 'transform';
              c.style.transition = 'transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.65, 0, .35, 1)';
              c.style.transform = `translateX(-${slotDist}px)`;
            }, 60 + idx * 80);
          });

          // 7 & 8: From 300ms — Counter rolls up and progress fill animates
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.updateCounter(nextIndex, 'up');
            this.updateProgress(nextIndex, true);
          }, 300);

          // 6. From 550ms — Text reveal: swap in new slide text and trigger staggered reveal
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.content.style.opacity = '1';
            this.content.style.transition = '';
            this.setupTextForReveal(nextSlide);
            this.triggerTextReveal();
          }, 550);

          // 4. 650ms: The new image becomes real background; expansion layer gently fades out
          setTimeout(() => {
            if (this.bgImage) {
              this.bgImage.src = nextSlide.bg || nextSlide.image;
              this.bgImage.style.display = 'block';
            }
            if (this.bgWrapper) {
              this.bgWrapper.style.willChange = 'filter';
              this.bgWrapper.style.transition = 'filter 500ms ease';
              this.bgWrapper.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';
            }

            // Gently fade out the expansion layer so it smoothly turns into the background
            layer.style.willChange = 'opacity';
            layer.style.transition = 'opacity 500ms cubic-bezier(.25, 1, .5, 1)';
            layer.style.opacity = '0';

            setTimeout(() => {
              layer.remove();
              if (this.bgWrapper) {
                this.bgWrapper.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';
                this.bgWrapper.style.transition = '';
                this.bgWrapper.style.willChange = '';
              }
            }, 520);

            // Rebuild track cards for the new activeIndex
            this.renderTrackCards(nextIndex);

            // Add the slide that just left as the last card, fade in from translateX(40px)
            const lastCard = this.track.lastElementChild;
            if (lastCard) {
              lastCard.style.opacity = '0';
              lastCard.style.transform = 'translateX(40px)';
              setTimeout(() => {
                lastCard.style.willChange = 'transform, opacity';
                lastCard.style.transition = 'transform 400ms cubic-bezier(.65, 0, .35, 1), opacity 400ms ease';
                lastCard.style.transform = 'translateX(0)';
                lastCard.style.opacity = '1';
              }, 50);
            }
          }, 650);

          // Settle at 1300ms
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.isAnimating = false;
            this.activeIndex = nextIndex;
            this.updateLiveRegion(nextIndex);
            this.preloadNext(nextIndex);

            // Reset will-change
            this.content.style.willChange = '';
            Array.from(this.track.children).forEach((c) => {
              c.style.willChange = '';
            });

            // Smooth scroll track back to start on mobile
            if (window.innerWidth <= 749) {
              this.track.scrollTo({ left: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
            }

            // Restart autoplay
            if (this.autoplayEnabled && !(window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode)) {
              this.startAutoplay();
            }
          }, 1300);
        }

        performPrevTransition(nextIndex, oldIndex) {
          const nextSlide = this.data[nextIndex];
          const oldSlide = this.data[oldIndex];

          const firstCard = this.track.children[0];
          const sectionRect = this.getBoundingClientRect();
          const cardRect = firstCard ? firstCard.getBoundingClientRect() : { top: 0, left: 0, width: 200, height: 300 };
          const top = Math.round(cardRect.top - sectionRect.top);
          const left = Math.round(cardRect.left - sectionRect.left);
          const right = Math.round(sectionRect.width - (left + cardRect.width));
          const bottom = Math.round(sectionRect.height - (top + cardRect.height));

          // Clean up any lingering layer from before
          const existingLayers = this.querySelectorAll('.dh-expand-layer');
          existingLayers.forEach((el) => el.remove());

          // Background shrinks back into card at first card slot
          const layer = document.createElement('div');
          layer.className = 'dh-expand-layer';
          layer.style.cssText = `
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 3;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
            clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 0px round 0px);
            will-change: clip-path, opacity;
          `;

          const layerImg = document.createElement('img');
          layerImg.src = oldSlide.bg || oldSlide.image;
          layerImg.alt = oldSlide.name;
          layerImg.style.cssText = `
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transform: scale(1);
            transform-origin: center center;
          `;
          layer.appendChild(layerImg);
          this.appendChild(layer);

          // Underlying background set to previous slide and brightens from .25 to 1
          if (this.bgImage) {
            this.bgImage.src = nextSlide.bg || nextSlide.image;
            this.bgImage.style.display = 'block';
          }
          if (this.bgWrapper) {
            this.bgWrapper.style.filter = 'brightness(0.25)';
            this.bgWrapper.style.transition = 'filter 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          }

          // Text fades out
          this.content.style.transition = 'opacity 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          this.content.style.opacity = '0.2';

          layer.offsetHeight; // Force reflow
          layer.style.transition = 'clip-path 650ms cubic-bezier(.76, 0, .24, 1)';
          layer.style.clipPath = `inset(${top}px ${right}px ${bottom}px ${left}px round 10px)`;
          if (this.bgWrapper) {
            this.bgWrapper.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';
          }

          // Cards shift right by one slot
          const cards = Array.from(this.track.children);
          const secondCard = cards[1];
          const slotDist = secondCard
            ? Math.round(secondCard.getBoundingClientRect().left - firstCard.getBoundingClientRect().left)
            : Math.round(firstCard.offsetWidth + 20);

          // Last card fades out to right
          const lastCard = cards[cards.length - 1];
          if (lastCard) {
            lastCard.style.transition = 'transform 400ms cubic-bezier(.65, 0, .35, 1), opacity 400ms ease';
            lastCard.style.transform = 'translateX(40px)';
            lastCard.style.opacity = '0';
          }

          cards.forEach((c, idx) => {
            setTimeout(() => {
              c.style.willChange = 'transform';
              c.style.transition = 'transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.65, 0, .35, 1)';
              c.style.transform = `translateX(${slotDist}px)`;
            }, 60 + idx * 80);
          });

          // From 300ms: Counter rolls down, progress fill animates
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.updateCounter(nextIndex, 'down');
            this.updateProgress(nextIndex, true);
          }, 300);

          // From 550ms: text reveal: swap in new slide text and trigger staggered reveal
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.content.style.opacity = '1';
            this.content.style.transition = '';
            this.setupTextForReveal(nextSlide);
            this.triggerTextReveal();
          }, 550);

          // At 650ms: update track, gently fade out shrunk layer
          setTimeout(() => {
            if (this.bgWrapper) {
              this.bgWrapper.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';
              this.bgWrapper.style.transition = '';
            }
            this.renderTrackCards(nextIndex);

            // Gently fade out shrunk layer over 300ms
            layer.style.willChange = 'opacity';
            layer.style.transition = 'opacity 300ms ease';
            layer.style.opacity = '0';

            setTimeout(() => {
              layer.remove();
            }, 320);
          }, 650);

          // Settle at 1300ms
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.isAnimating = false;
            this.activeIndex = nextIndex;
            this.updateLiveRegion(nextIndex);
            this.preloadNext(nextIndex);

            this.content.style.willChange = '';
            Array.from(this.track.children).forEach((c) => {
              c.style.willChange = '';
            });

            if (window.innerWidth <= 749) {
              this.track.scrollTo({ left: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
            }

            if (this.autoplayEnabled && !(window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode)) {
              this.startAutoplay();
            }
          }, 1300);
        }
      }

      customElements.define(tag, ProductHero);
    })();
  </script>
</product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

